flowchart TD
  Req["Incoming HTTP Request"] --> Pub{"Public Route?\n/health, /schedules, /semester"}
  Pub -->|Yes| Val["validate-request.js\nCheck path / query / body"]
  Pub -->|No| Auth["auth.js Middleware (PBI 10)\nVerify JWKS, iss, exp, azp"]

  Auth -->|Missing / Invalid Token| E401["401 Unauthorized\napplication/problem+json"]
  Auth -->|Wrong Role / Not Self| E403["403 Forbidden\napplication/problem+json"]
  Auth -->|OK| Val

  Val -->|Collect ALL invalid fields| E400["400 Bad Request\ntype: validation-error"]
  Val -->|Valid| Ctrl["Routes -> Controllers\nParse params & body"]
  Ctrl --> Svc["Services Layer\nBusiness Logic + Prisma"]

  Svc -->|Resource Missing| E404["404 Not Found\nselection-not-found / section-not-found"]
  Svc -->|Duplicate or Time Overlap| E409["409 Conflict\nalready-selected -> schedule-clash"]
  Svc -->|Success| OK["200 / 201 / 204 Response"]
